  "hero_headline": "全球动荡加剧：AI具身智能突破与欧洲抗议潮并存 / Global Volatility: AI Embodied Intelligence Breakthroughs and European Unrest",
  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦AI具身智能的实质性进展，优必选等机构在物理世界模型与VLA技术上取得基准测试第一，展示了AI从虚拟到物理操控的进化潜力；同时，AI基础设施投融资市场出现分化，部分高估值企业面临资金流动性考验。财经与地缘政治方面，中东局势升级冲击海运与能源供应，尼日尔能源出口禁令及红海船只袭击事件推高通胀担忧。欧洲多国爆发大规模生活成本抗议活动，显示通胀与地缘摩擦对社会稳定的持续侵蚀。综合来看，全球宏观经济正面临供应链碎片化与地缘风险的深度叠加，投资者与企业需在AI技术红利与动荡的政治环境间寻求平衡。\n\nToday, the tech sector is focused on substantial progress in embodied AI, with breakthroughs in world models and VLA technology showcasing AI's potential to transition from virtual tasks to physical manipulation. Meanwhile, AI infrastructure financing is seeing divergence, as high-valuation firms face liquidity tests. In finance and geopolitics, the escalating conflict in the Middle East is straining maritime routes and energy supplies, while Niger's fuel export ban and attacks on vessels in the Red Sea amplify inflationary pressures. Widespread protests over the cost of living across Europe highlight how inflation and geopolitical friction are eroding social stability. Overall, the global macro environment is currently defined by the collision of supply chain fragmentation and geopolitical volatility, necessitating a strategic balance between AI-driven productivity gains and mounting systemic risks.",
